yst, Inc (HCAT). This chart runs from Oct 1, 2024 to Feb 10, 2025.","setup":"The stock rose about 45% in the three months before the base. It then formed a base for about 6 weeks, peaking at $9.04 and pulling back 20% at its deepest. Daily price ranges tightened on the right side of the base.","outcome":"On Dec 18, 2024 it closed at $7.27, below the base's floor of $7.36, without ever closing above the base high of $9.04. Volume that day was 581K shares, 1.04x the prior 10-day average. It kept sliding, down to $5.32, and the chart ends at $5.75.","lesson":"This is an example of a breakdown. The stock built what looked like a base, then broke out of the bottom instead of the top. There was never a breakout to buy. When a base gives way below, the move is to stay out, or get out fast if you bought early."}}